 "main_html": "<section class=\"mdgov-section\">\n<div id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_editmodepanel2\">\n<h1 class=\"mdgov-section__heading\">Strengthening Resilience, Supporting Innovation</h1>\n</div>\n<div id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1_label\" style=\"display:none\">Main_Content</div><div aria-labelledby=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1_label\" class=\"ms-rtestate-field\" id=\"ctl00_PlaceHolderMain_RichHtmlField1__ControlWrapper_RichHtmlField\" style=\"display:inline\"><p>\n<span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'><img alt=\"a solar field on a sunny day\" src=\"/SiteAssets/Pages/resiliency/iStock-1029635382.jpg\" style=\"margin:5px;width:1051px;height:450px;\"/><br/></span></p><p>\n<span style='color:#262626;font-family:\"segoe ui semilight\", \"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:600;'>Grants &amp; Loans​​</span></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;width:823px;height:159px;\"><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;width:233px;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">\n<a href=\"/business/Pages/Maryland-RISE.aspx\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\" target=\"_blank\">Maryland RISE Program</a><br/></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">​​This program will provide funds from \r\n            <a href=\"https://netl.doe.gov/bilhub/grid-resilience/formula-grants\" target=\"_blank\">Section 40101(d) of the 2021 Bipartisan Infrastrucutre Law​</a> to electricity grid operators and related stakeholders to help fund improvements to the electricity grid.<br/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;width:233px;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">\n<a href=\"/business/pages/ResilientMaryland.aspx\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\" target=\"_blank\">Resilient Maryland</a><br/></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">​​Provides grants for the planning, design, and installation of microgrids, resilient facility power systems, and solar plus battery storage systems for resiliency hubs.<br/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;width:233px;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\"><a href=\"/Pages/Energy-Storage-Grant-Program.aspx\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\" target=\"_blank\">Residential and Commercial Energy Storage Grant Program​</a><br/></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">​​Provides grants to Maryland residents and organizations to help install qualified energy storage systems on their properties.​<br/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;width:233px;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">​<a href=\"/Pages/OpenEnergyGrantProgram.aspx\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\" target=\"_blank\">Open Energy Innovation Grant Program​</a><br/></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">​​The Maryland Energy Administration is interested in receiving proposals that fall outside the range of its other ENERGY programs. <br/></td></tr></tbody></table><h3></h3><h3>\n<br/>\n</h3><h3>Tax Credits<br/></h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-attachment:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;width:823px;height:78px;\"><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;width:138px;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">\n<a href=\"/business/Pages/EnergyStorage.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">​Energy Storage Tax Credit Program</a><br/></td><td rowspan=\"1\" style=\"padding:7.5pt;width:233px;background-color:transparent;\" valign=\"top\">​Take advantage of this Maryland State income tax credit for your qualified energy storage system.<br/></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<br/>\n<div><p>\n<span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>For program updates,</span><span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'> follow us on social media ​(</span><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MDEnergyAdministration\" style='background-color:#ffffff;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>Facebook</a><span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>, </span><a href=\"https://twitter.com/MDEnergy\" style='background-color:#ffffff;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>Twitter</a><span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>, or</span><span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'> </span><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/maryland-energy-administration/?viewAsMember=true\" style='background-color:#ffffff;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>LinkedIn</a><span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>), or bookmark this page or our​ </span><a href=\"/Pages/news.aspx\" style='background-color:#ffffff;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>News page</a><span style='color:#777777;font-family:\"segoe ui\", segoe, tahoma, helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:600;'>. All programs are subject to available funds.</span><br/></p>When possible, please submit applications electronically to avoid mail delays. Staff will confirm receipt of electronic applications within one to two business days via email. If you have mailed in your application, we ask that you contact us via phone at 410-537-4000 or 1-800-72-ENERGY or email at <a href=\"mailto:DLInfo_MEA@maryland.gov\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;\"><span class=\"__cf_email__\" data-cfemail=\"fdb9b1b4939b92a2b0b8bcbd909c8f84919c9399d39a928b\">[email protected]</span> ​</a>to confirm receipt.​<br/></div></div>\n</section>"
